      "notes": [
        "Nine request types will cover softcopy creation/revision/cancellation, hardcopy creation/update, transfer, disposal, access and assignment.",
        "Submission will capture a published route. Approve, Reject and Return will update the active step and history; final approval will apply the selected operation.",
        "Only the transfer requester will dispatch. Recipient acceptance will change custody/location, remove the previous personal grant and complete the request.",
        "Only the owner will be allowed to delete a cancelled, never-submitted draft. D1-D4 are specified on sheet 8; audit capture links to process 6.0 on sheet 7."
      ]
